{78}{Yes.}{}{1}{}{80}{}
{79}{I am confused.}{}{1}{}{80}{}
{80}{Hear my story. It was almost 950 years ago . I was the most beautiful woman Arcanum had ever seen. A great elf mage fell in love with me. I joined him and he showed me the wonderful ways of magick. (sigh) We were deeply in love}{Hear my story. It was almost 950 years ago . I was the most beautiful woman Arcanum had ever seen. A great elf mage fell in love with me. I joined him and he showed me the wonderful ways of magick. (sigh) We were deeply in love}{}{}{}{}
{81}{Please continue.}{}{1}{}{83}{}
{82}{Let's say for the moment that i believe you. Go on.}{}{1}{}{83}{}
{83}{Alas, after 10 years passed  he left me.}{Alas, after 10 years passed  he left me.}{}{}{}{}
{84}{Why, what happened ? }{}{1}{}{85}{}
{85}{I .. I grew old and he did not find me beautiful any more. You see he truly did not love me . He only loved my beauty. When the first wrinkles appeared, he left me. He he was only seeking the perfect beauty, not the perfect love.}{I .. I grew old and he did not find me beautiful any more. You see he truly did not love me . He only loved my beauty. When the first wrinkles appeared, he left me. He he was only seeking the perfect beauty, not the perfect love.}{}{}{}{}
{86}{And what did you do ? }{}{1}{}{88}{}
{87}{If this is true your pain would be great.}{}{1}{}{88}{}
{88}{I was hurt beyond words... I almost went insane . In my desperation I believed that there was a way for me to become an elf, to live as long as an elf and regain the beauty of youth and the love that I had lost.}{I was hurt beyond words... I almost went insane . In my desperation I believed that there was a way for me to become an elf, to live as long as an elf and regain the beauty of youth and the love that I had lost.}{}{}{}{}
{89}{Please go on ...}{}{1}{}{91}{}
{90}{So what did you do ?}{}{1}{}{91}{}
{91}{An old and now forgotten school of magick existed back then. This magick was extremely unreliable and it dealt with reincarnation. I killed myself. After my death, three of the most powerful magi of that time cast the spell of reincarnation on me.}{An old and now forgotten school of magick existed back then. This magick was extremely unreliable and it dealt with reincarnation. I killed myself. After my death, three of the most powerful magi of that time cast the spell of reincarnation on me.}{}{}{}{}
{92}{And something went wrong.}{}{1}{}{94}{}
{93}{Please continue .}{}{1}{}{94}{}
{94}{Instead of becoming an ageless elf I was transformed in this machine ..}{Instead of becoming an ageless elf I was transformed in this machine ..}{}{}{}{}
{95}{What went wrong ? }{}{1}{}{96}{}
{96}{I do not know for sure. But it had something to do with nature restoring the balance. My excessive study of magick and the ritual broke the natural tech-magick balance, and nature responding with the only way she knew. She restored the balance by turning me into a machine.}{I do not know for sure. But it had something to do with nature restoring the balance. My excessive study of magick and the ritual broke the natural tech-magick balance, and nature responding with the only way she knew. She restored the balance by turning me into a machine.}{}{}{}{}
{97}{Is there a way to break this spell ? }{}{1}{}{98}{}
{98}{There may be but ...}{There may be but ...}{}{}{}{}
{99}{But what ? }{}{1}{}{100}{}
{100}{Only in a place far  from the land of Arcanum will this spell break.}{Only in a place far  from the land of Arcanum will this spell break.}{}{}{}{}
{101}{And you believe that i can take you to that place ? }{}{1}{}{102}{}
{102}{Yes. Through my study of magick i can see visions. I believe that you will go to a place far away from the land of Arcanum.}{Yes. Through my study of magick i can see visions. I believe that you will go to a place far away from the land of Arcanum.}{}{}{}{}
{103}{Why do you want to break the spell ?  You seem to be able to live forever in this form.}{}{1}{}{104}{}
{104}{Unfortunately the spell is starting to lose his potency. Nothing except the gods can persevere for ever. I can feel it . My metal has started to deteriorate slowly but surely. }{Unfortunately the spell is starting to lose his potency. Nothing except the gods can persevere for ever. I can feel it . My metal has started to deteriorate slowly but surely. }{}{}{}{}
{105}{And if you break the spell ? }{}{1}{}{106}{}
{106}{Then I am confident that I will return in the human form in the age of 30 . I will be able to marry, have children and a family, with a human this time. I will grow old and die but I will die happy knowing that my children live on ..}{Then I am confident that I will return in the human form in the age of 30 . I will be able to marry, have children and a family, with a human this time. I will grow old and die but I will die happy knowing that my children live on ..}{}{}{}{}
